OL,3,GNEWSAMurdered woman's family make
OL,4,Aappeal 30 years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman whose murder
OL,7,Fremains unsolved 30 years after she was
OL,8,Fkilled has urged anyone with
OL,9,Finformation to come forward.
OL,11,FVera Holland, 47, was last seen alive
OL,12,Fon 14 November 1996 after she left her
OL,13,Fhome in St Barnabas Road in Reading,
OL,14,FBerkshire, to buy a takeaway from KFC
OL,15,Fin Shinfield Road.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
