OL,3,GNEWSAMurdered woman's family make
OL,4,Aappeal 30 years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe failed to return home and was
OL,7,Freported missing. Her body was found
OL,8,Ftwo days later on a fly-tip close to
OL,9,Fthe Thames Water pumping station on the
OL,10,FA327 between Arborfield and Shinfield,
OL,11,Fabout three miles (4.8km) away. She had
OL,12,Fbeen strangled.
OL,14,FSpeaking on behalf of Holland's family,
OL,15,Fher daughter Dawn Bennett said her
OL,16,Ffamily "feels the loss and heartbreak
OL,17,Fof losing her every day".
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
